sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Initiator
    participant B as Responder
    Note over A,B: Round 1
    A->>B: offer (terms t1, signed)<br/>free/busy [required by initiator], email [optional]<br/>use for scheduling only, delete within 1 day, no distribution
    Note over B: Owner policy check,<br/>may ask owner
    B-->>A: counter (terms t2, ref t1, signed)<br/>drops email, adds no AI training [required by responder]
    Note over A,B: Round 2
    alt Terms acceptable
        A->>B: accept (ref t2, signature)
        Note over A,B: Agreement record: t2 + both signatures
        B-->>A: data (agreement t2): free/busy
        A->>B: close
    else Counter removed or weakened a required term
        A->>B: error: required-term-removed
    else No agreement, or max_rounds reached
        A->>B: reject
    end
